  "No entries for this month. Use the New-entry button, the Invoice tool, or your phone — everything shows here.": {"st":"Ha ho dikenyelletso tsa kgwedi ena. Sebedisa konopo ya Kenyelletso e ntjha, sesebediswa sa Invoyese, kapa fono ya hao — tsohle di bontshwa mona.","ve":"A hu na zwiṅwalwa kha ṅwedzi uyu. Shumisani batani ya Tshiṅwalwa tshitswa, tshishumiswa tsha Invoisi, kana founu yaṋu — zwoṱhe zwi a vhoniwa hafha.","ts":"A ku na switsalwa eka n'hweti leyi. Tirhisa buti ra Xitsalwa xintshwa, xitirhisiwa xa Invoyisi, kumbe foni ya wena — hinkwaswo swi vonaka laha."},
  "No entries for this season. Use the New-entry button, the Invoice tool, or your phone — everything shows here.": {"st":"Ha ho dikenyelletso tsa sehla sena. Sebedisa konopo ya Kenyelletso e ntjha, sesebediswa sa Invoyese, kapa fono ya hao — tsohle di bontshwa mona.","ve":"A hu na zwiṅwalwa kha khalaṅwaha iyi. Shumisani batani ya Tshiṅwalwa tshitswa, tshishumiswa tsha Invoisi, kana founu yaṋu — zwoṱhe zwi a vhoniwa hafha.","ts":"A ku na switsalwa eka nguva leyi. Tirhisa buti ra Xitsalwa xintshwa, xitirhisiwa xa Invoyisi, kumbe foni ya wena — hinkwaswo swi vonaka laha."},
  "No entries for this year. Use the New-entry button, the Invoice tool, or your phone — everything shows here.": {"st":"Ha ho dikenyelletso tsa selemo sena. Sebedisa konopo ya Kenyelletso e ntjha, sesebediswa sa Invoyese, kapa fono ya hao — tsohle di bontshwa mona.","ve":"A hu na zwiṅwalwa kha ṅwaha uyu. Shumisani batani ya Tshiṅwalwa tshitswa, tshishumiswa tsha Invoisi, kana founu yaṋu — zwoṱhe zwi a vhoniwa hafha.","ts":"A ku na switsalwa eka lembe leri. Tirhisa buti ra Xitsalwa xintshwa, xitirhisiwa xa Invoyisi, kumbe foni ya wena — hinkwaswo swi vonaka laha."},
