  "No quantity recorded": {"zu":"Akukho nani elirekhodiwe","st":"Ha ho bongata bo ngotsweng","ve":"A hu na tshivhalo tsho ṅwalwaho","ts":"A ku na nhlayo leyi tsariweke"},
  "No receipt photo is saved for this cost on this device. Edit the cost to attach one, or open it on the device where you saved the photo.": {"st":"Ha ho setshwantsho sa rasiti se bolokilweng bakeng sa tshenyehelo ena fonong ena. Fetola tshenyehelo ho kenya setshwantsho, kapa e bule fonong eo o bolokileng setshwantsho ho yona.","ve":"A hu na tshifanyiso tsha risidi tsho vhulungwaho kha mbadelo iyi kha founu iyi. Shandulani mbadelo u engedza tshithihi, kana ni i vule kha founu ine na vhulunga khayo tshifanyiso.","ts":"A ku na xifaniso xa risiti lexi hlayisiweke eka xihakelo lexi eka xitirhisiwa lexi. Cinca xihakelo lexi ku engetela xin'we, kumbe u xi pfula eka xitirhisiwa lexi u xi hlayiseke eka xona."},
  "No sales logged": {"st":"Ha ho dithekiso tse ngotsweng","ve":"A hu na thengiso yo ṅwalwaho","ts":"A ku na ku xavisa loku tsariweke"},
