  "No sales or costs logged for this month.": {"st":"Ha ho dithekiso kapa ditshenyehelo tse ngotsweng bakeng sa kgwedi ena.","ve":"A hu na thengiso kana mbadelo yo ṅwalwaho kha ṅwedzi uyu.","ts":"A ku na ku xavisa kumbe tihakelo leti tsariweke eka n'hweti leyi."},
  "No sales or costs logged for this season.": {"st":"Ha ho dithekiso kapa ditshenyehelo tse ngotsweng bakeng sa sehla sena.","ve":"A hu na thengiso kana mbadelo yo ṅwalwaho kha khalaṅwaha iyi.","ts":"A ku na ku xavisa kumbe tihakelo leti tsariweke eka nguva leyi."},
  "No sales or costs logged for this year.": {"st":"Ha ho dithekiso kapa ditshenyehelo tse ngotsweng bakeng sa selemo sena.","ve":"A hu na thengiso kana mbadelo yo ṅwalwaho kha ṅwaha uyu.","ts":"A ku na ku xavisa kumbe tihakelo leti tsariweke eka lembe leri."},
  "No trustworthy guide price is stored for this crop. Enter the price you actually agreed.": {"zu":"Akukho ntengo ethembekile yesiqondiso egciniwe yalesi sitshalo. Faka intengo oyivumelene ngempela.","st":"Ha ho theko ya tataiso e ka tshepahalang e bolokilweng bakeng sa sejalo sena. Kenya theko eo le e dumelaneng ka yona ruri.","ve":"A hu na mutengo wa nyeletshedzo une wa fulufhedzea o vhulungwaho wa tshiliṅwa itshi. Ṅwalani mutengo we na tendelana nao vhukuma.","ts":"A ku na ntsengo wa nkongomiso lowu tshembekaka lowu hlayisiweke eka xibyariwa lexi. Faka ntsengo lowu u wu pfumeleleneke ha wona hakunene."},
  "Nothing logged yet": {"st":"Ha ho letho le ngotsweng ho fihlela jwale","ve":"A hu na tshithu tsho ṅwalwaho zwino","ts":"A ku na leswi tsariweke ku fikela sweswi"},
  "Only tag a crop when this cost was just for that crop.": {"st":"Tshwaya sejalo feela ha tshenyehelo ena e ne e le ya sejalo seo feela.","ve":"Ṋeani tshiliṅwa tshiga fhedzi musi mbadelo iyi i tshi vha ya tshiliṅwa tshenetsho fhedzi.","ts":"Hlawula xibyariwa ntsena loko xihakelo lexi xi ri xa xibyariwa lexi ntsena."},
  "Only what you have written down.": {"st":"Ke feela seo o se ngotseng.","ve":"Ndi zwo ṅwalwaho nga inwi fhedzi.","ts":"Ku ri leswi u swi tsaleke ntsena."},
  "Open a fully-worked demo farm. Your own books are not touched.": {"st":"Bula polasi ya mohlala e sebeditsweng ka botlalo. Dibuka tsa hao ha di a amiwa.","ve":"Vulani bulasi ya tsumbo yo ṅwalwaho zwoṱhe. Bugu dzaṋu a dzi kwamiwi.","ts":"Pfula purasi ra xikombiso leri heleleke. Tirhekhodo ta wena a ti khumbiwi."},
  "Open full size": {"st":"Bula ka boholo bohle","ve":"Vulani nga vhuhulu hoṱhe","ts":"Pfula hi vukulu hinkwabyo"},
  "Opening receipt…": {"st":"Ho bula rasiti…","ve":"Risidi i khou vulwa…","ts":"Ku pfula risiti…"},
  "Optional AI reading uses your connection. You can also fill in the cost yourself.": {"st":"Ho bala ka AI ke boikgethelo mme ho sebedisa marang-rang a hao. O ka boela wa kenya ditshenyehelo ka bowena.","ve":"U vhala nga AI (arali ni tshi ṱoḓa) hu shumisa inthanethe yaṋu. Ni kha ḓi nga ṅwala mbadelo ni ṋoṋe."},
  "Orchard & food forest": {"st":"Serapa sa difate tsa ditholwana le sekgwa sa dijo","ve":"Ngade ya miri ya mitshelo na tshisaka tsha zwiḽiwa","ts":"Ntanga wa mirhi ni mirhi ya swakudya"},
  "Orchard / other": {"st":"Serapa sa difate / tse ding","ve":"Ngade ya miri ya mitshelo / zwiṅwe","ts":"Ntanga wa mirhi / swin'wana"},
  "Orchard in": {"st":"Serapa sa difate se kenyeletswe","ve":"Ngade ya mitshelo yo katelwa","ts":"Ntanga wa mirhi wu katsiwile"},
  "Orchard is switched off, so {kg} kg is not in Yield logged: {names}. Income and recorded cash margin still count every sale.": {"st":"Serapa sa difate tsa ditholwana se timilwe, ka hona {kg} kg ha e kenyeletswe ho Kotulo e ngotsweng: {names}. Lekeno le tjhelete e setseng e ngotsweng di ntse di bala dithekiso kaofela.","ve":"Ngade ya miri ya mitshelo yo dzimwa, ngauralo {kg} kg a zwi katelwi kha Khaṋo yo ṅwalwaho: {names}. Mbuelo na masheleni o salaho o ṅwalwaho zwi kha ḓi vhala thengiso dzoṱhe.","ts":"Ntanga wa mirhi wu timiwile, hikwalaho {kg} kg a yi katsiwanga eka Ntshovelo lowu tsariweke: {names}. Muholo ni mali leyi saleke leyi tsariweke swi ha hlayela ku xavisa hinkwako."},
  "Orchard is switched off, so {kg} kg is not in the harvest figure: {names}. The rand figures still count every sale.": {"st":"Serapa sa difate tsa ditholwana se timilwe, ka hona {kg} kg ha e kenyeletswe palong ya kotulo: {names}. Palo ya diranta e ntse e bala dithekiso kaofela.","ve":"Ngade ya miri ya mitshelo yo dzimwa, ngauralo {kg} kg a zwi katelwi kha mbalo ya khaṋo: {names}. Mbalo dza rand dzi kha ḓi vhala thengiso dzoṱhe.","ts":"Ntanga wa mirhi wu timiwile, hikwalaho {kg} kg a yi katsiwanga eka nhlayo ya ntshovelo: {names}. Tinhlayo ta tirhandi ti ha hlayela ku xavisa hinkwako."},
  "Orchard is switched off, so {kg} kg is not in the weight above: {names}. The rand total still counts every sale, orchard included.": {"st":"Serapa sa difate se timilwe, ka hona {kg} kg ha e kenyeletswe boimong bo ka hodimo: {names}. Kakaretso ya diranta e ntse e bala dithekiso tsohle, ho kenyeletswa tsa serapa sa difate.","ve":"Ngade ya miri ya mitshelo yo dzimwa, ngauralo {kg} kg a zwi katelwi kha vhulemu ha ngei nṱha: {names}. Mbalo ya rand i kha ḓi vhala thengiso dzoṱhe, na dza ngade ya miri ya mitshelo.","ts":"Ntanga wa mirhi wu timiwile, hikwalaho {kg} kg a yi katsiwanga eka vutika lebyi nge henhla: {names}. Nhlayo hinkwayo ya tirhandi yi ha hlayela ku xavisa hinkwako, ku katsa ni ntanga wa mirhi."},
  "Orchard is switched off, so {kg} kg is not in this total: {names}. Nothing was deleted — switch it back on to count it again.": {"st":"Serapa sa difate se timilwe, ka hona {kg} kg ha e kenyeletswe palong ena: {names}. Ha ho letho le hlakotsweng — se bulele hape ho se bala hape.","ve":"Ngade ya miri ya mitshelo yo dzimwa, ngauralo {kg} kg a zwi katelwi kha mbalo iyi: {names}. A hu na tshithu tsho bviswaho — i vhaseni hafhu uri i vhalwe.","ts":"Ntanga wa mirhi wu timiwile, hikwalaho {kg} kg a yi katsiwanga eka nhlayo leyi hinkwayo: {names}. A ku na nchumu lowu susiweke — wu katse nakambe leswaku wu hlayiwa nakambe."},
