  "Sourced guide — enter the price you actually agreed.": {"zu":"Isiqondiso esivela emthonjeni — faka intengo oyivumelene ngempela.","st":"Tataiso e tswang mohloding — kenya theko eo le e dumelaneng ka yona ruri.","ve":"Nyeletshedzo yo wanwaho — ṅwalani mutengo we na tendelana nao vhukuma.","ts":"Nkongomiso lowu humaka eka xihlovo — faka ntsengo lowu u wu pfumeleleneke ha wona hakunene."},
