  "Thank you · Keep this receipt": {"st":"Re a leboha · Boloka rasiti ena","ve":"Ri a livhuwa · Vhulungani risidi iyi","ts":"Inkomu · Hlayisa risiti leyi"},
  "The cost was saved, but its receipt could not be confirmed on this device. Keep the photo and retry this cost.": {"zu":"Izindleko zilondoloziwe, kodwa irisidi lazo alikwazanga ukuqinisekiswa kule divayisi. Gcina isithombe bese uzama lezi zindleko futhi.","st":"Tshenyehelo e bolokilwe, empa rasiti ya yona ha e a ka ya netefatswa fonong ena. Boloka setshwantsho mme o leke hape tshenyehelo ena.","ve":"Mbadelo yo vhulungwa, fhedzi risidi yayo a ya ngo khwaṱhisedzwa kha founu iyi. Dzulisani tshifanyiso ni dovhe ni lingedze mbadelo iyi.","ts":"Xihakelo xi hlayisiwile, kambe risiti ya xona a yi tiyisisiwanga eka xitirhisiwa lexi. Hlayisa xifaniso u ringeta nakambe xihakelo lexi."},
  "The entry is saved on your phone, waiting for the server to confirm. Any attached receipt photo stays on this device only.": {"st":"Kenyelletso e bolokilwe fonong ya hao, e emetse hore seva e e netefatse. Setshwantsho sefe kapa sefe sa rasiti se kentsweng se dula fonong ena feela.","ve":"Tshiṅwalwa tsho vhulungwa kha founu yaṋu, tshi khou lindela uri sava i tshi khwaṱhisedze. Tshifanyiso tsha risidi tshiṅwe na tshiṅwe tsho engedzwaho tshi dzula kha founu iyi fhedzi.","ts":"Xitsalwa xi hlayisiwile eka foni ya wena, xi rindzele leswaku sevha yi xi tiyisisa. Xifaniso xin'wana ni xin'wana xa risiti lexi khomekeke xi tshama eka xitirhisiwa lexi ntsena."},
  "The item, supplier and total are ready. Check them against the receipt before saving.": {"st":"Ntho, mofani le palo ya kaofela di lokisitswe. Di bapise le rasiti pele o boloka.","ve":"Tshithu, muṋetshedzi na mbalo yoṱhe zwo lugiselwa. Zwi vhambedzeni na risidi ni sa athu vhulunga."},
  "The receipt could not be saved on this device. Storage may be full or unavailable. Keep the original photo and try again.": {"zu":"Irisidi alilondolozekanga kule divayisi. Indawo yokugcina ingase igcwele noma ingatholakali. Gcina isithombe sokuqala bese uzama futhi.","st":"Rasiti ha e a ka ya bolokwa fonong ena. Sebaka sa polokelo se kanna sa tlala kapa sa se fumanehe. Boloka setshwantsho sa mantlha mme o leke hape.","ve":"A ro ngo kona u vhulunga risidi kha founu iyi. Fhethu ha u vhulunga hu nga vha ho ḓala kana hu si hone. Dzulisani tshifanyiso tsha u thoma ni lingedze hafhu.","ts":"Risiti a yi hlayisiwanga eka xitirhisiwa lexi. Ndhawu yo hlayisa yi nga ha tala kumbe yi nga tirhi. Hlayisa xifaniso xa ku sungula u ringeta nakambe."},
  "These are not rows in the list above because every figure there is worked out per square metre of bed, and fruit off a tree does not come off a bed. The sales here are already counted in the money below.": {"st":"Tsena ha se mela lenaneng le ka hodimo hobane palo e nngwe le e nngwe moo e balwa ka lemetara e nngwe ya sekwere ya bethe, mme ditholwana tsa sefate ha di tswe bethe. Dithekiso tsa mona di se di badilwe tjhelete e ka tlase.","ve":"Hezi a si mitsetse kha mutevhe ngei nṱha ngauri nomboro dzoṱhe ngei dzi balelwa nga m² nthihi ya mubhede, nahone mitshelo ya muri a i bvi mubhedeni. Thengiso dzi re hafha dzo ḓi vhalwa kha masheleni ngei fhasi.","ts":"Leswi a hi milayini eka lisiti leyi nge henhla hikuva nhlayo yin'wana ni yin'wana kona yi hlayiwa hi mita yin'we ya xikwere ya mubhedhi, naswona mihandzu ya xihlahla a yi humi eka mubhedhi. Ku xavisa laha se ku hlayiwile eka mali leyi nge hansi."},
  "This AI feature is switched off. You can change your AI settings or continue manually.": {"zu":"Lesi sici se-AI sicishiwe. Ungashintsha izilungiselelo zakho ze-AI noma uqhubeke ngesandla.","st":"Karolo ena ya AI e timilwe. O ka fetola dipeakanyo tsa hao tsa AI kapa wa tswela pele ka letsoho.","ve":"Mushumo uyu wa AI wo dzimwa. Ni nga shandukisa magagulo a AI kana ni bvele phanḓa ni tshi i ita ni ṋoṋe.","ts":"Xitirhisiwa lexi xa AI xi timiwile. U nga cinca swilulamiso swa wena swa AI kumbe u yisa emahlweni hi voko."},
  "This export is disabled while you are viewing the Ubhejane farm. Sign in and turn off the tour to export your own records.": {"zu":"Lokhu kukhipha kuvaliwe ngenkathi ubuka ipulazi lase-Ubhejane. Ngena ngemvume bese uvala uhambo lokubonisa ukuze ukhiphe amarekhodi akho siqu.","st":"Ho ntsha mona ho thibetswe ha o ntse o sheba polasi ya Ubhejane. Kena mme o time leeto la ho bontsha, o be o ntshe direkoto tsa hao ka bowena.","ts":"Ku humesa loku ku timiwile loko u ri karhi u languta purasi ra Ubhejane. Nghena u tlhela u tima riendzo leswaku u humesa tirhekhodo ta wena."},
  "This farm": {"st":"Polasi ena","ve":"Bulasi iyi","ts":"Purasi leri"},
  "This file is not a readable JPG, PNG or WebP photo. Choose another image.": {"zu":"Leli fayela alilona isithombe se-JPG, PNG noma WebP esifundekayo. Khetha esinye isithombe.","st":"Faele ena ha se setshwantsho sa JPG, PNG kapa WebP se balehang. Kgetha setshwantsho se seng.","ve":"Faela iyi a si tshifanyiso tsha JPG, PNG kana WebP tshi vhaleaho. Khethani tshiṅwe tshifanyiso.","ts":"Fayili leyi a hi xifaniso xa JPG, PNG kumbe WebP lexi hlayekaka. Hlawula xifaniso xin'wana."},
