  "Works offline. The original photo saves with this cost on this device only. JPG, PNG or WebP, up to 10 MB.": {"st":"E sebetsa ntle le marang-rang. Setshwantsho sa mantlha se bolokwa le tshenyehelo ena fonong ena feela. JPG, PNG kapa WebP, ho fihla ho 10 MB.","ve":"Zwi shuma ni si na inthanethe. Tshifanyiso tsha u thoma tshi vhulungwa na mbadelo iyi kha founu iyi fhedzi. JPG, PNG kana WebP, u swika kha 10 MB.","ts":"Swi tirha handle ka inthanete. Xifaniso xa ku sungula xi hlayisiwa ni xihakelo lexi eka xitirhisiwa lexi ntsena. JPG, PNG kumbe WebP, ku fika eka 10 MB."},
  "Yield": {"st":"Kotulo","ve":"Khaṋo","ts":"Ntshovelo"},
  "Yield leads: it compares growing work even when prices change.": {"st":"Kotulo e etella pele: e bapisa mosebetsi wa ho lema le ha ditheko di fetoha.","ve":"Khaṋo i vha phanḓa: i vhambedza mushumo wa u lima naho mitengo i tshi shanduka.","ts":"Ntshovelo wu rhangela: wu ringanisa ntirho wo kurisa hambi loko tintsengo ti cinca."},
