  "You are offline — showing what is saved on this device. Anything missing will appear when you have signal again.": {"st":"Ha o na marang-rang — ho bontshwa se bolokilweng fonong ena. Se sa bonahaleng se tla hlaha ha o fumana marang-rang hape.","ve":"A ni na inthanethe — zwi khou sumbedzwa zwo vhulungwaho kha founu iyi. Zwine zwa shoda zwi ḓo vhonala musi inthanethe i tshi vha hone hafhu."},
  "You kept {amount}": {"st":"O boloketse {amount}","ve":"Ni salile na {amount}","ts":"U hlayisile {amount}"},
  "You spent {amount} more than you made": {"st":"O sebedisitse {amount} ho feta seo o se fumaneng","ve":"Ni shumisile {amount} nga u fhirisa zwine na zwi wana","ts":"U hakele {amount} ku tlula leswi u swi kumeke"},
  "You're offline. The entry is saved on your phone, waiting to send. Any attached receipt photo stays on this device only.": {"st":"Ha o na marang-rang. Kenyelletso e bolokilwe fonong ya hao, e emetse ho romelwa. Setshwantsho sefe kapa sefe sa rasiti se kentsweng se dula fonong ena feela.","ve":"A ni na inthanethe. Tshiṅwalwa tsho vhulungwa kha founu yaṋu, tshi khou lindela u rumelwa. Tshifanyiso tsha risidi tshiṅwe na tshiṅwe tsho engedzwaho tshi dzula kha founu iyi fhedzi.","ts":"A wu na inthanete. Xitsalwa xi hlayisiwile eka foni ya wena, xi rindzele ku rhumeriwa. Xifaniso xin'wana ni xin'wana xa risiti lexi khomekeke xi tshama eka xitirhisiwa lexi ntsena."},
  "You're offline. This is saved on your phone and will reach the cloud the moment you have signal again.": {"zu":"Awuxhunyiwe. Lokhu kulondolozwe ocingweni lwakho futhi kuzofinyelela elifini ngokushesha lapho usuthola uxhumano futhi.","st":"Ha o na marang-rang. Sena se bolokilwe fonong ya hao mme se tla fihla leroung hang ha o fumana marang-rang hape.","ve":"A ni na inthanethe. Izwi zwo vhulungwa kha founu yaṋu nahone zwi ḓo swika kha klaudu hu tshi tou vha na inthanethe hafhu.","ts":"A wu na inthanete. Leswi swi hlayisiwile eka foni ya wena naswona swi ta fika eka cloud hi ku hatlisa loko u tlhela u va na inthanete."},
  "Your account changed. Reopen this cost before asking Lima to read it.": {"st":"Akhaonto ya hao e fetohile. Bula hape tshenyehelo ena pele o kopa Lima ho e bala.","ve":"Akhaunthu yaṋu yo shanduka. Vulani hafhu mbadelo iyi ni sa athu humbela Lima u i vhala.","ts":"Akhawunti ya wena yi cincile. Pfula nakambe xihakelo lexi u nga se kombela Lima ku xi hlaya."},
  "Your account or workspace changed. Reopen this cost before saving its receipt.": {"zu":"I-akhawunti noma indawo yakho yokusebenza kushintshile. Vula lezi zindleko futhi ngaphambi kokulondoloza irisidi lazo.","st":"Akhaonto kapa sebaka sa hao sa mosebetsi di fetohile. Bula hape tshenyehelo ena pele o boloka rasiti ya yona.","ve":"Akhaunthu yaṋu kana fhethu ha mushumo zwo shanduka. Vulani hafhu mbadelo iyi ni sa athu vhulunga risidi yayo.","ts":"Akhawunti kumbe ndhawu ya wena ya ntirho yi cincile. Pfula nakambe xihakelo lexi u nga se hlayisa risiti ya xona."},
  "Your connection dropped mid-save. Nothing is lost — this is saved on your phone and will finish sending on its own.": {"zu":"Uxhumano lwakho lunqamukile ngenkathi kulondolozwa. Akukho okulahlekile — lokhu kulondolozwe ocingweni lwakho futhi kuzoqeda ukuthunyelwa ngokuzenzakalelayo.","st":"Marang-rang a hao a nyametse ha ho ntse ho bolokwa. Ha ho letho le lahlehileng — sena se bolokilwe fonong ya hao mme se tla qeta ho romelwa ka bosona.","ve":"Inthanethe yaṋu yo fhelela musi zwi tshi khou vhulungwa. A hu na tshithu tshi xelaho — izwi zwo vhulungwa kha founu yaṋu nahone zwi ḓo fhedza u rumelwa zwi ṋoṋe.","ts":"Inthanete ya wena yi tsemakanile loko ku ri karhi ku hlayisiwa. A nchumu wu lahlekanga — leswi swi hlayisiwile eka foni ya wena naswona swi ta heta ku rhumeriwa hi swexe."},
